{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o073b","title":"立卞氏为皇后大赦","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o073b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"立卞氏为皇后大赦","evidence":["shaodi-e-o073b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0077","role":"受立","evidence":["shaodi-e-o073b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":255,"label":"三月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y255","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o072","basis":"三月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o073b-q","shaodi-q-o072","shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o073b-q","source_order":[4,334,"O073b"],"order":1148}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0077","name":"卞皇后（曹髦后）","evidence":["shaodi-q-o073","houfei-q-o015"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o073-shaodi-p0077","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o073"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o015-shaodi-p0077","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o015"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o015","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-cd762afb3ecc487b5c66","layer":"original","quote":"兰子隆女，高贵乡公皇后。隆以后父，为光禄大夫，位特进，封睢阳乡侯；妻王为显阳乡君。追封隆前妻刘，为顺阳乡君，后亲母故也〖17〗。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o073b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-edb853525f526ca4c6d7","layer":"original","quote":"甲子〖18〗，吴大将孙峻等众号十万〖19〗，至寿春；诸葛诞拒击破之，斩吴左将军留赞〖20〗，献捷于京都。三月，立皇后卞氏〖21〗，大赦。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗二年：正元二年（公元 255）。乙丑：旧历十二日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-96103ace1e11ae4131ba","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o072","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4b9070779d1c209c6814","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月，乙丑〖6〗，镇东将军毌丘俭、扬州刺史文钦反。（戊戌）〔戊寅〕〖7〗，大将军司马景王征之。癸未〖8〗，车骑将军郭淮薨。闰月，己亥〖9〗，破钦于乐嘉〖10〗；钦遁走，遂奔吴。甲辰〖11〗，安风淮津都尉斩俭〖12〗，传首京都。﹝一﹞壬子〖13〗，复特赦淮南士民诸为俭、钦所诖误者〖14〗。以镇南将军诸葛诞为镇东大将军〖15〗。司马景王薨于许昌。二月，丁巳〖16〗，以卫将军司马文王为大将军〖17〗，录尚书事。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o073","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-edb853525f526ca4c6d7","layer":"original","quote":"甲子〖18〗，吴大将孙峻等众号十万〖19〗，至寿春；诸葛诞拒击破之，斩吴左将军留赞〖20〗，献捷于京都。三月，立皇后卞氏〖21〗，大赦。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
